OL,3,GNEWSABradford 'needs new hospital',
OL,4,Acouncil told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of Bradford Royal Infirmary
OL,7,F(BRI) has told councillors: "We need a
OL,8,Fnew hospital, plain and simple."
OL,10,FProf Mel Pickup, chief executive of
OL,11,FBradford Teaching Hospitals NHS
OL,12,FFoundation Trust, said at a council
OL,13,Fscrutiny committee that much of BRI was
OL,14,Fmore than 100 years old.
OL,16,FShe told members it would likely cost
OL,17,Fmore to repair and upgrade the existing
OL,18,Fbuilding than it would to build a new
OL,19,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
