OL,3,GNEWSABradford 'needs new hospital',
OL,4,Acouncil told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThese claims were first raised in BRI's
OL,7,Funsuccessful bid to be considered for
OL,8,Fthe government's New Hospital
OL,9,FProgramme, a proposal which would have
OL,10,Fseen the hospital and St Luke's
OL,11,Fdemolished and re-built on a single
OL,12,Fsite.
